  {"slug":"codeium","website_url":"https://codeium.com","pricing_model":"freemium","pricing_details":"Free tier for Windsurf plugin users across VS Code, JetBrains, Vim, and other editors; paid Pro/Teams tiers align with Cognition/Windsurf subscriptions.","tagline":"Free AI completions and chat plugins for 70+ IDEs — the extension layer behind Windsurf.","description":"Codeium now primarily refers to the Windsurf plugin ecosystem for developers who stay in JetBrains, VS Code, or other editors. The company rebranded its flagship IDE to Windsurf and was acquired by Cognition in 2025."},
