  {"slug":"manus-ai","website_url":"https://manus.im","pricing_model":"freemium","pricing_details":"Subscription plans available; Meta's December 2025 acquisition faces regulatory review as of April 2026.","tagline":"General-purpose autonomous agent acquired by Meta amid regulatory review.","description":"Manus AI is an autonomous agent for browsing, research, coding, files, and multi-step digital work. Meta acquired Manus in December 2025, but regulatory review leaves ownership and roadmap uncertain as of May 2026."},
