  {"slug":"lovable","website_url":"https://lovable.dev","pricing_model":"freemium","pricing_details":"Pro from $25/mo; Business from $50/mo. Lovable Cloud and Lovable AI billed separately on usage-based pricing.","tagline":"Conversational full-stack app builder with integrated Lovable Cloud and Lovable AI.","description":"Lovable lets teams describe, iterate on, and deploy web apps with Supabase, GitHub, and custom domains. In 2025–2026 it added Lovable Cloud and Lovable AI, billed via usage-based Stripe pricing on top of build credits."},
